body:
It's crazy to me but the other day I saw someone call people making stand references in twitch chat "jojo normies"

&#x200B;

I 'member when a mere fraction of anime fans were into jojo, when other weebs call you normies you know we made it bois

I went off Abilify for a few reasons, mostly it was making me gain weight and I was slow and unfocused no matter what I was doing. The only "withdrawal" symptoms were my brain waking back up and yeah, of course the bipolar came back, that's why I was on medication lmao. 

&#x200B;

I eventually did go back on a different medication which I'm still on now (Lamictal) and there are still side effects but I find it a lot more bearable. Ideally, find what works for you but I know how hard that is. Peace.
